{"type":"Film","id":"FR2017_141","slug":"fr2017-141-le-sens-de-la-fete","title":{"native":"Le Sens de la fête","english":"C'est la vie!"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2017-10-04","year":2017},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Olivier Nakache","slug":"olivier-nakache","name":"Olivier Nakache","birthYear":1973,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2019-174-hors-normes","title":{"native":"Hors normes"}},"year":2020,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Director","result":"Nominated"},{"film":{"slug":"fr2017-141-le-sens-de-la-fete","title":{"native":"Le Sens de la fête"}},"year":2018,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Director","result":"Nominated"}]},{"id":"Éric Toledano","slug":"eric-toledano","name":"Éric Toledano","birthYear":1971,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2019-174-hors-normes","title":{"native":"Hors normes"}},"year":2020,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Director","result":"Nominated"},{"film":{"slug":"fr2017-141-le-sens-de-la-fete","title":{"native":"Le Sens de la fête"}},"year":2018,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Director","result":"Nominated"}]}],"genre":["Comedy"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/41/187/178985/format_page/le-sens-de-la-fete.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ErV26mIdEvU"},"synopsis":{"native":"Max est traiteur depuis trente ans. Des fêtes il en a organisé des centaines, il est même un peu au bout du parcours. Aujourd'hui c'est un sublime mariage dans un château du 17ème siècle, un de plus, celui de Pierre et Héléna. Comme d'habitude, Max a tout coordonné : il a recruté sa brigade de serveurs, de cuisiniers, de plongeurs, il a conseillé un photographe, réservé l'orchestre, arrangé la décoration florale, bref tous les ingrédients sont réunis pour que cette fête soit réussie... Mais la loi des séries va venir bouleverser un planning sur le fil où chaque moment de bonheur et d'émotion risque de se transformer en désastre ou en chaos. Des préparatifs jusqu'à l'aube, nous allons vivre les coulisses de cette soirée à travers le regard de ceux qui travaillent et qui devront compter sur leur unique qualité commune : Le sens de la fête.","english":"Max has been a caterer for thirty years. He's organized hundreds of parties, he's even a bit over it all. Today it's a magnificent wedding, yet another one, in a seventeenth century château. This time, Pierre and Héléna are getting married. As usual, Max has coordinated everything: he's hired his brigade of waiters, cooks, and dishwashers, advised the couple on a photographer, reserved the orchestra, arranged the floral decorations, in short, all the ingredients have been brought together so that the celebration is a success... But the law of series will soon come to disturb the finely timed planning, so that each moment of happiness and emotion risks turning into a disaster or chaos. From the preparations until to dawn, we will experience the action behind the scenes of this party through the gaze of those who work and who must count on their single common quality: the sense of a party."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"},{"country":"Canada","share":"Minority coproducer"},{"country":"Belgium","share":"Minority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"FR2017_141_01","film":"FR2017_141","person":{"id":"Jean-Pierre Bacri","slug":"jean-pierre-bacri","name":"Jean-Pierre Bacri","birthYear":1951,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2017-141-le-sens-de-la-fete","title":{"native":"Le Sens de la fête"}},"year":2018,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Actor Male","result":"Nominated"},{"film":{"slug":"fr2015-174-la-vie-tres-privee-de-monsieur-sim","title":{"native":"La Vie très privée de Monsieur Sim"}},"year":2016,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Actor Male